WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Actually I know I have this problem

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Will panic when encountering an emergency

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
It’s just that my father was Dan Bing back then.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,000
I have always admired him

5
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,480
That's why I had this dream

6
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:11,480
This decision is not because of you

7
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,480
but for me

8
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:15,890
Later I also went to see a psychiatrist

9
00:00:15,890 --> 00:00:17,890
She said if I continue

10
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:18,890
Pressure will lead everyone

11
00:00:18,890 --> 00:00:19,890
To be honest

12
00:00:19,890 --> 00:00:21,890
My sleep quality has improved recently

13
00:00:21,890 --> 00:00:23,890
But I think I should come and apologize to you.

14
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:25,890
What if I asked you to write about mental disorder again in the future?

15
00:00:25,890 --> 00:00:26,890
Don't worry

16
00:00:26,890 --> 00:00:27,890
I'm fine

17
00:00:27,890 --> 00:00:28,890
You can find the major that really suits you

18
00:00:28,890 --> 00:00:29,890
so good

19
00:00:29,890 --> 00:00:30,890
From now on, I will be a classmate of the logistics department.

20
00:00:30,890 --> 00:00:32,890
If you have the opportunity in the future, you must come and help me.

21
00:00:32,890 --> 00:00:34,890
We, Dan Bing, are just doing your logistics work.

22
00:00:34,890 --> 00:00:35,890
I will work hard

23
00:00:35,890 --> 00:00:37,890
It seems we don’t have friends yet

24
00:00:37,890 --> 00:00:38,890
Add one

25
00:00:38,890 --> 00:00:39,890
I must award it

26
00:00:39,890 --> 00:00:41,890
I'll give you a note
